<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 400s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 5th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 400s BCE, 393 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 54 were founded and 41 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Achaemenid Empire, the Athens and the Roman Republic.</p></header>
